Subject: [PATCH] 9620: Rewrite garbled CBRANCH paragraph in the SLEIGH
 documentation

The second CBRANCH paragraph was leftover search-and-replace fragments. Restore it to describe the if-goto syntax, which is the information that was trying to be there.

Co-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>
