 GhidraDocs/languages/html/sleigh_constructors.html | 9 +++------
 1 file changed, 3 insertions(+), 6 deletions(-)

diff --git a/GhidraDocs/languages/html/sleigh_constructors.html b/GhidraDocs/languages/html/sleigh_constructors.html
index 2ab46368c1..8e772b7ffa 100644
--- a/GhidraDocs/languages/html/sleigh_constructors.html
+++ b/GhidraDocs/languages/html/sleigh_constructors.html
@@ -1592,12 +1592,9 @@ taken, and a destination annotation.
 <p>
 </p>
 <p>
-As in the above example, the <span class="emphasis"><em>CBRANCH</em></span> operation
-takes two inputs, a boolean value indicating whether or operation is
-invoked with the <span class="bold"><strong>if goto</strong></span> operation
-takes two inputs, a boolean value indicating whether or syntax. The
-condition of the <span class="bold"><strong>if</strong></span> operation takes
-two inputs, a boolean value indicating whether or can be any semantic
+As in the above example, the <span class="emphasis"><em>CBRANCH</em></span> operation is
+invoked with the <span class="bold"><strong>if goto</strong></span> syntax. The
+condition of the <span class="bold"><strong>if</strong></span> can be any semantic
 expression that results in a boolean value. The destination must be an
 annotation varnode.
 </p>
